        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/miami/scene_flamingo.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository f3e796af-bc6f-41db-8694-1424235250e7).Image",
        "Description": "Welcome to Miami, 47.\r\rIt&apos;s time to create some headlines. To local Floridians, Mr. Velmorres and Mr. Kindane, have each made a rather odd request of us. Each has asked us to eliminate the other in a way that is simulatneously flashy and accidental.\r\rHowever, this being Florida, neither seems to have thought this through, as they have both asked for the kill to be accidental, AND to make sure that the bodies aren&apos;t found.\r\rWell, I know you aren&apos;t one to refuse a request, 47.\r\rGood luck.",
